#/** @file
#
#  EVB10 vendor device tree blob, built from Rockchip's own DTS by
#  ../../../tools/build-evb10-dtb.sh.
#
#  The .dtb next to this file is generated, not hand-edited: it is
#  rk3588-evb10-v10-linux.dts out of kernel-6.12 with /chosen/bootargs
#  removed. Re-run the script instead of patching the blob.
#
#  Copyright (c) 2024, Mario Bălănică <mariobalanica02@gmail.com>
#  Copyright (c) 2026, UniXNU contributors. All rights reserved.
